{{Quote|I'm already there. That place is in my head. They can build as many barracks as they like, they'll never find me.|[[Maarva Carassi Andor]]|<ref name="Andor7">{{Andor|Announcement}}</ref>}}
In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Date" /> a robust '''garrison'''<ref name="SecondEdition">[[Star Wars Encyclopedia of Starfighters and Other Vehicles (second edition)|''Star Wars Encyclopedia of Starfighters and Other Vehicles'' (second edition)]]</ref> of the [[Imperial Army]] was established on the [[planet]] [[Ferrix]] to establish the [[Galactic Empire]]'s new authority over the world<ref name="TAF" /> and, in the wake of the chaotic [[ambush on Ferrix]],<ref name="Announcement">{{Andor|Announcement}}</ref> quell any form of possible uprising.<ref name="SecondEdition" /> Composed mainly of [[Imperial security trooper]]s but also including a smaller number of [[stormtrooper]]s,<ref name="Rix Road" /> the deployment was established following the removal of [[Consolidated Holdings of Preox-Morlana Corporation|Preox-Morlana's]] authority over the [[Free Trade sector|Morlana sector]] due to the ambush on Ferrix.<ref name="Aldhani">{{Andor|Aldhani (episode)}}</ref> They were headquartered in [[Hotel Rix]].<ref name="TAF" />

